      "widgets_values": [
        "The first frame and the last frame are the authoritative source for the girl's identity, her hair, her clothing, the classroom, the wooden desk, the open notebook and the warm afternoon window light. Keep the same girl and the same room throughout. <Audio 1> is the voice reference: use its timbre for every spoken line. She begins asleep face-down on the desk and ends fully awake sitting upright.\n\n[Shot 1] At 00:00.000, she stays asleep, face down on her folded arms, only her shoulders rising slowly with her breathing, warm sunlight and floating dust drifting across the desk. She does not speak.\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.500, her fingers twitch on the notebook and her eyebrows move; she stirs a little without lifting her head. <d>嗯……</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:04.500, she lifts her head off the desk, hair falling forward across her cheek, eyes still shut, then slowly blinks them open. <d>欸……我睡了喔</d>\n[Shot 4] At 00:07.000, she sits fully upright and rubs her left eye with one hand, a small yawn, a faint red sleep mark on her cheek. <d>現在幾點了呀</d>",
        864,
        480,
        243,
        "Hybrid — 关键帧+参考混合生成",
        "reference_only",
        0.35,
        true,
        1,
